SUMMARY:Special Event: Carsen White aka Nurse Stankk
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Born as Carsen White but spiritually forged in the chaos of a 3
  a.m. ER shift\, Nurse Stankk is what happens when sleep deprivation\, trau
 ma\, and dark humor evolve into a full-blown personality instead of a copin
 g mechanism. Known for his chaotic storytelling\, brutally honest takes\, a
 nd slightly concerning level of transparency\, Nurse Stankk has built a loy
 al online following of healthcare workers who finally feel seen… and civi
 lians who are now mildly terrified to ever visit the ER again.\n\nWith mill
 ions of views across social media as [handle removed]\, Carsen has brought 
 his unfiltered healthcare comedy from the internet to stages across the cou
 ntry. He has performed at iconic venues including the Comedy Store\, Aspen 
 Laugh Festival\, Hero’s Off Duty Tour\, and multiple Improvs nationwide.\
 n\nWhether you’re a nurse\, first responder\, healthcare worker\, or just
  emotionally unstable enough to relate\, Nurse Stankk delivers the kind of 
 comedy that feels like a post-shift breakdown with your funniest coworker.\
 n\nCouples Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage cr
 edit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserv
 es the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem 
 disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.a
 pp/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-carsen-white-aka-nurse-stankk/
